cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PLATO tools, please cite them as below."
title: "PLATO tools"
abstract: >-
  Tools for data about places in the formats of PLATO, the Place Attestation
  Ontology: check it, convert it, compare two versions of it, publish it. They
  run in the browser, with the files kept on the user's own computer, and from
  the command line for many files at a time.
type: software
authors:
